* text=auto eol=lf

*.md       diff=markdown
*.php      diff=php
*.blade.php linguist-language=PHP

# ⚠️ Constitution Principle VI / AGENTS.md R-036.
#
# Development tooling MUST be excluded from the distribution archive BEFORE the
# first tag. A tag cannot be retracted, so archive hygiene is a release blocker
# rather than polish. Verify with the check in quickstart.md § Release gate:
#
#   git archive --format=tar HEAD | tar -t | grep -E '^(specs|tests|\.specify|...)'
#
# ⚠️ resources/dist/ is deliberately NOT export-ignored — it is the runtime.
# resources/css/ and resources/js/ are the SOURCES that build into it, and only
# those are excluded.
/.github            export-ignore
/.specify           export-ignore
/.claude            export-ignore
/specs              export-ignore
/tests              export-ignore
/resources/css      export-ignore
/resources/js       export-ignore
/.gitattributes     export-ignore
/.gitignore         export-ignore
/AGENTS.md          export-ignore
/CLAUDE.md          export-ignore
/phpunit.xml.dist   export-ignore
/phpstan.neon.dist  export-ignore
/pint.json          export-ignore
/package.json       export-ignore
/build.mjs          export-ignore
